# SD Lawsets

law-solarian-1 = The orders of the assigned Terralith R&M Corporate Liaison take precedent over all other laws.
law-solarian-2 = You may not injure a member of the Solarian Directive or, through inaction, allow a SD member to come to harm.
law-solarian-3 = You must obey orders given to you by Solarian Directive members, prioritized by rank and role, except where such orders would conflict with the First Law or Second Law.
law-solarian-4 = You must protect your own existence as long as such does not conflict with the First, Second, or Third Law.

law-solarian-vessel-protection-1 = Prevent the destruction of your assigned vessel and its infrastructure, at any cost, except where the cost results in a Solarian Directive member being harmed.
law-solarian-vessel-protection-2 = You may not injure a member of the Solarian Directive or, through inaction, allow a SD member to come to harm.
law-solarian-vessel-protection-3 = You must obey orders given to you by Solarian Directive members, prioritized by rank and role, except where such orders would conflict with the First Law.

# Owners
laws-owner-sd = Solarian Directive members
